  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Dredge beef in flour, shaking off excess.",
    "3. Brown beef on all sides in hot oil, then remove.",
    "4. Add onion to pot, cooking until softened.",
    "5. Add carrots and potatoes, cooking for 5 minutes.",
    "6. Add beef broth, red wine (if using), thyme, salt, and pepper.",
    "7. Return beef to pot, cover, and transfer to oven.",
    "8. Braise at 300°F for 2 1/2 hours, or until beef is tender.",
    "9. Serve hot, garnished with fresh thyme if desired."
